    "text": "Artesia Daily News\nwebsite\nRuidoso\nRed tape and indifference slow disaster recovery\n11 hours ago\nExactly one day before the Rio Ruidoso swelled from 18 inches to 20 feet of death and destruction, Mayor Lynn Crawford told legislators that money they approved for disaster recovery is bottled up. “The process is broke,” he said. “What you passed, we don’t have access to.”\n1",
